# Anti-patterns · Verify / ship

Always loaded (short). The base evidence table lives in the installed verify-work skill; project-specific rows live in the project's verify-work addons — do not duplicate either here.

- Claiming done without proving the matching base + addon evidence rows same turn — later review passes, typecheck/lint/unit alone, or git commit/push of prior runtime diffs do **not** replace live proof
- “Verified” UI without live UI **or** without visual proof in the reply
- Writing off a verify gap or learning a new evidence class only in chat — name the gap; update the project addons (+ topic anti-pattern when it will repeat, via living-docs dedupe gate)
- Half-fixing an explicit ask — ship the affordance; UI layout needs scroll-to-end proof
- Inventing a parallel without the dedupe gate — docs and components: search → merge prefer invent → reply names strengthened/extended vs added/invented
